{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4ew4XiJuhyyZM2c75L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The iron around it is worn smooth by countless hands that tried before you.*\n\n*I do not speak. I do not move. But you feel it — the faint pull of air through the keyhole, as if something on the other side is breathing.*\n\n*Insert the key.*\n\n**🔒**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}